blic","site_admin":false},"body":"## Why\n\nThe final v16 source `6ecd8023615a6e0b2dc269379fb059c656b38b6f` is qualified and integrated, but public main still only exposes the selected v9 installer. The old installer cannot interpret v16's expanded inventory while preserving its executing-source identity checks. Reviewers also need the original success, failure, scope and cost evidence after CI artifacts expire.\n\n## Changes\n\n- Add the unchanged 47,762-byte original B source-CI lock as `releases/hia-v16-6ecd802.json` and a byte-identical B installer under a versioned filename. The current v9 lock, helper and shared preflight retain their exact original blobs.\n- Run independent current/v16 public-installation rows, preserving all original fetch/materialize/check, task-input, native-example and installation-manifest gates and the 35-minute limit. Current still uses the real default with no lock override.\n- Retain B's original **19/19** successful workflow cohort and the separate post-integration **22/22** cohort, including original Lean HTTP-504 failures, bounded reruns, conditional skips and the earlier running-state snapshot. PR817/808 integrated the same qualified B commit into the source baselines.\n- Preserve all 28,122 exact-source and 1,796 full-NDU original member streams plus original scalar/controller data, independent readers and scoped reports. Retain actual-main v9 and runtime PR111 Linux-CI observations.\n- Update the six-track review: the bounded narrowed kernel passes 9/9 training and 21/21 holdout performance comparisons, while matched scalar/controller and distinct-code opportunity results do not establish incremental NDU/economic value. The original Agent four-claim task still fails its strict evaluation gate.\n\n## Validation and boundaries\n\nTwo independent static reviews checked the five entry paths, original lock/helper/preflight bytes, YAML, Bash syntax, embedded Python AST, original gate preservation and command argument order. The full publication tree was calculated locally and matched GitHub's created tree exactly: `a3fa0ac98769cd4a1aadd8513c4c88d5c3172930`. All 262 JSON files parse; all 35 relative document links resolve; all three default-path Git blobs remain unchanged. Artifact readers check original bytes without executing project/native/solver code.\n\nThis PR's own CodeQL and both public installation jobs are required before merge; actual-main installation must be observed afterward. Source CI does not replace those gates. This metadata publication does not activate an online service or select a new default runtime. General Core completeness, general machine correctness, original Agent-delta adoption/provider costs and stable incremental/economic benefit remain **HOLD**.\n\nThe original publication contains 395 changed paths, mostly retained audit evidence; executable-entry changes are limited to the five reviewed paths above. Full source remains on the separately qualified source branches.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-09T07:03:47Z","updated_at":"2026-11-09T07:03:57Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"733fd7dce91dcf91900487e64edce4f9e17917c0","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"TrillionniumFoundation:codex/hia-sixgap-entry-v16-e5ee-20261109","ref":"codex/hia-sixgap-entry-v16-e5ee-20261109","repo":{"id":1432132756,"node_id":"R_kgDOVVyclA","name":"Hepta","full_name":"TrillionniumFoundation/Hepta","owner":{"login":"TrillionniumFoundation","id":262513357,"node_id":"O_kgDOD6WizQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/262513357?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation","html_url":"https://github.com/TrillionniumFoundation","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TrillionniumFoundation/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https:/